WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.751 --> 00:00:03.167
PETER QUILL
I'm a tell you something...

00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:04.959
...I'm Star-Lord.

00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:08.459
I formed the Guardians.

00:00:10.626 --> 00:00:12.626
Met a girl, fell in love...

00:00:13.792 --> 00:00:15.167
...that girl died.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.334
But then she came back.

00:00:16.417 --> 00:00:17.375
GAMORA
[Yelling]

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:19.584
PETER QUILL
Came back a total dick.

00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:21.250
GAMORA
Oh please.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:23.876
NEBULA
You left out some important information

00:00:23.918 --> 00:00:26.876
but that is the gist of it.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.667
♫ I get the same old dreams
same time every night ♫

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:34.834
♫ Fall to the ground
and I wake up ♫

00:00:36.584 --> 00:00:37.876
THE HIGH EVOLUTIONARY
My sacred mission...

00:00:39.542 --> 00:00:41.876
...is to create the perfect society.

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:46.375
ROCKET
He didn't wanna make things perfect...

00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:50.375
ROCKET
...he just hated things the way they are.

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:55.125
♫ Since you been gone ♫

00:00:57.125 --> 00:00:59.125
♫ Since you been gone ♫

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:03.459
♫ I'm out of my head
can't take it ♫

00:01:03.542 --> 00:01:05.542
DRAX
I want you all to know that I am grateful

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:07.125
 to fight beside my friends.

00:01:07.918 --> 00:01:09.042
THE HIGH EVOLUTIONARY
Incinerate them.

00:01:14.626 --> 00:01:16.125
[Laughing]

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:22.959
PETER QUILL
We were always searching for a family...

00:01:23.709 --> 00:01:25.042
...until we found each other.

00:01:30.083 --> 00:01:30.626
Are you ready...

00:01:32.042 --> 00:01:33.042
...for one last ride?

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:35.125
DRAX
Yeah! [Laughing]

00:01:35.125 --> 00:01:40.459
♫ Ever since you been gone ♫

00:01:40.459 --> 00:01:42.000
ROCKET
We'll all fly away together...

00:01:43.584 --> 00:01:44.667
...into the forever...

00:01:45.125 --> 00:01:46.250
[Screaming]

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:49.751
ROCKET
...and beautiful sky.

00:01:50.959 --> 00:01:52.751
♫ Since you been gone ♫

00:01:54.959 --> 00:01:56.959
♫ Since you been gone ♫

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:02.209
GAMORA
Whoever it was that you were in love with,

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:03.459
it sounds more like her.

00:02:03.626 --> 00:02:04.209
- Her?
- What?

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.667
- That's ridiculous. Don't even...
- Do not bring me into this.

00:02:06.709 --> 00:02:07.417
[Laughing]

00:02:09.209 --> 00:02:10.042
NEBULA
Knock it off!

00:02:10.125 --> 00:02:10.626
PETER QUILL
What?

00:02:11.334 --> 00:02:12.959
I just never noticed how
black your eyes were.

00:02:13.125 --> 00:02:15.167
NEBULA
They were replaced by my father

00:02:15.209 --> 00:02:16.626
as a method of torture.

00:02:16.667 --> 00:02:18.876
PETER QUILL
He picked a pretty set.

